    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460330/extras/4da51ec54d75f9671e62b4528e93a81f.avif?t=1742962684\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE - EXPAND - CONQUER:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>NEXUS</strong>, a hostile world where survival is only the beginning. In this open-world co-op PvE shooter, you\u2019ll join a team of sci-fi mercenaries tasked with securing resources, crafting powerful gear, and pushing back relentless android swarms that threaten humanity\u2019s colonization efforts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460330/extras/bb698328da893e2d4d066bc05d948f04.avif?t=1742962684\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Open-World MMO-Like Co-op</strong> \u2013 Team up with friends or go solo in a vast, ever-evolving world filled with dangers and opportunities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense PvE Combat</strong> \u2013 Use an arsenal of high-tech weaponry and customizable subclasses to take on massive android hordes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Resource Gathering</strong> \u2013 Deploy <strong>Miners</strong> to extract vital resources\u2014but be ready to defend them against waves of enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Progression System</strong> \u2013 Level up, unlock new gear, and upgrade your armor to take on even greater threats. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Territory Expansion &amp; Raids</strong> \u2013 Reclaim lost ground, establish fortified outposts, and tackle high-risk, high-reward <strong>Raid Miners</strong> for the ultimate challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460330/extras/6c16060843f50e2c3626933a76624ee7.avif?t=1742962684\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STORY:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After arriving at <strong>NEXUS</strong>, humanity\u2019s last hope for colonization, disaster struck. A mysterious force of ruthless androids attacked, forcing survivors to retreat into scattered outposts. With limited resources and only a fraction of the colony awake from cryosleep, mercenaries like you are humanity\u2019s best chance to reclaim what was lost. Gather resources, expand settlements, and fight back before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to turn the tide? <strong>Gear up. Drop in. Take back NEXUS.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist <strong>NEXUS_DROP</strong> now and prepare for battle!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460330/extras/4da51ec54d75f9671e62b4528e93a81f.avif?t=1742962684\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE - EXPAND - CONQUER:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>NEXUS</strong>, a hostile world where survival is only the beginning. In this open-world co-op PvE shooter, you\u2019ll join a team of sci-fi mercenaries tasked with securing resources, crafting powerful gear, and pushing back relentless android swarms that threaten humanity\u2019s colonization efforts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460330/extras/bb698328da893e2d4d066bc05d948f04.avif?t=1742962684\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Open-World MMO-Like Co-op</strong> \u2013 Team up with friends or go solo in a vast, ever-evolving world filled with dangers and opportunities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense PvE Combat</strong> \u2013 Use an arsenal of high-tech weaponry and customizable subclasses to take on massive android hordes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Resource Gathering</strong> \u2013 Deploy <strong>Miners</strong> to extract vital resources\u2014but be ready to defend them against waves of enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Progression System</strong> \u2013 Level up, unlock new gear, and upgrade your armor to take on even greater threats. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Territory Expansion &amp; Raids</strong> \u2013 Reclaim lost ground, establish fortified outposts, and tackle high-risk, high-reward <strong>Raid Miners</strong> for the ultimate challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460330/extras/6c16060843f50e2c3626933a76624ee7.avif?t=1742962684\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STORY:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After arriving at <strong>NEXUS</strong>, humanity\u2019s last hope for colonization, disaster struck. A mysterious force of ruthless androids attacked, forcing survivors to retreat into scattered outposts. With limited resources and only a fraction of the colony awake from cryosleep, mercenaries like you are humanity\u2019s best chance to reclaim what was lost. Gather resources, expand settlements, and fight back before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to turn the tide? <strong>Gear up. Drop in. Take back NEXUS.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist <strong>NEXUS_DROP</strong> now and prepare for battle!</p>",
